                "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
              }
            ],
            "remediation": "Declare the SBOM's completeness: the 2026 Coverage element expects all components including transitive dependencies, and information gaps must be explicitly stated as unknown or deliberately withheld. This rule verifies the declaration, not actual completeness — the document itself points to external repositories / binary analysis for that. SPDX 2.x has no completeness declaration, so the rule is not evaluated for SPDX 2.x documents. CycloneDX: set compositions[].aggregate (complete, incomplete, incomplete_first_party_only, …); the first composition is read.",
